            "notes": "## **Round 3 \u2013 Power Spike: Orb Overload**\n\n* Pick:  [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) +  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6).\n\n* Why: These two create an **endless Biotic Power loop:**\n\n    * Biotic Grasp (heal) generates orbs.\n\n    * Fade drops a healing orb.\n\n    * Your standard Biotic Orb.\n\n* **Result:** You\u2019re generating orbs from **three sources** \u2014 and never run out of energy. Fade is off cooldown before your Biotic energy is depleted.\n\n* **Tip:** Keep orbs bouncing around you as a **shield of healing.**",
